<title>FRANCE: M6 TV firm net attrib up 3.2 pct in 1996.</title>
<headline>M6 TV firm net attrib up 3.2 pct in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for full year 1996.</p>
<p>(in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable			     355  vs	     344</p>
<p>    Turnover				     2,375  vs	   2,042</p>
<p>NOTE - The television group said in a statement said the net attributable figure rose by 3.2 percent.</p>
<p>The figure included a net loss of 16.4 million francs for its part in the new TPS digital television venture, in which it has a 20 percent stake. Total consolidated, net attributable profit would have risen eight percent if this had been excluded.</p>
<p>TPS, launched on December 17 and a rival to CanalSatellite, has 43,000 subscribers, M6 said.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
